      en: ["Nyong River length: 690 km", "Drainage basin: 28,000 km²", "Average elevation: 300 m", "Annual rainfall: 1,600–2,000 mm", "Population density: 50 per km²", "Annual cocoa production: 60,000 tonnes"],
